{
  "_doc": [
    "Per-class metadata that pipe_data_builder.py uses to construct each",
    "class's pipe-row table. Replaces the AI-generated `pipe_data` field.",
    "",
    "Schema:",
    "  • size_groups       — named arrays of NPS strings, referenced by class",
    "                        entries to avoid repeating 22-size lists 85 times",
    "  • pipe_profiles     — named pipe-block combos shared by multiple classes",
    "                        (pipe_code / transition_nps / small_bore /",
    "                         large_bore / ends / fittings). When >=2 classes",
    "                        share the same MOC/transition combo, factor into",
    "                        a profile so the duplicate doesn't have to be",
    "                        repeated per class.",
    "  • classes[code]     — per-class entry, two flavours:",
    "      A) profile + sizes (compact form, most classes):",
    "         { profile: 'CS_A', sizes: 'A_full' }",
    "         Plus optional per-class overrides for any profile field",
    "         (most commonly `pipe_code` for SS/DSS/SDSS A/G-series).",
    "      B) full inline (one-off classes — A6, A70, A30/A40/A50/A51/A52/A60):",
    "         { pipe_code, sizes, transition_nps, small_bore, large_bore,",
    "           ends, fittings, [explicit_dimensions, cpvc_uses_asme_od, ...] }",
    "",
    "Resolution: get_class_meta(code) merges profile fields with class fields,",
    "class wins. So a class with `profile: 'DSS'` and a per-class `pipe_code`",
    "gets all DSS defaults except pipe_code.",
    "",
    "Engineering values (od_mm, schedule, wall_thickness_mm) are computed by",
    "pipe_data_builder.py at request time, not stored here:",
    "  • od_mm comes from pipe_dimensions.json (canonical ASME B36.10M)",
    "  • schedule + wall_thickness_mm come from dual-case Eq. 3a + project",
    "    floor (see pipe_data.correct_pipe_data and project_schedule_floors.json)",
    "",
    "Non-ASME classes (CuNi A30, Copper A40, GRE A50/51/52, CPVC A60, Titanium",
    "A70, Tubing T80*/T90*) carry explicit per-NPS od_mm/wall_thickness_mm",
    "tables since their dimensions don't follow ASME B36.10M.",
    "",
    "When a new class is added: append it to `classes` (use a profile if a",
    "matching one exists, else inline), restart the server."
  ],
