  "_fittings_doc": [
    "Fittings are built deterministically by fittings_builder.py from the",
    "same metadata that drives pipe_data_builder. Each class's pipe_profile",
    "(or inline class entry) names a `fitting_group`; the builder applies",
    "the global `fitting_standards` defaults for fields that are constant",
    "across all classes (elbow, tee, reducer, cap, weldolet — all ASME",
    "B 16.9 / B 16.11 / MSS SP 97).",
    "",
    "Fittings transition NPS defaults to the pipe transition_nps. Override",
    "via `fittings_transition_nps` on a class only when the project spec",
    "puts the fittings split at a different size than the pipe split."
  ],
