  "_pipe_profiles_doc": [
    "Pipe profiles capture the {pipe_code, transition_nps, small_bore,",
    "large_bore, ends, fittings} combination shared by multiple classes.",
    "Each entry in `classes` references one via `profile`; the per-class",
    "size_group lives in the `sizes` field. Classes can override any",
    "profile field — most commonly `pipe_code` for the SS / DSS / SDSS",
    "A-series and G-series variants where the standards citation differs",
    "from the dual citation used by B/D/E/F.",
    "",
    "Add a new profile when >=2 classes share an identical pipe block.",
    "One-off classes (Epoxy A6, Titanium A70, all non-ASME) stay inline."
  ],
